// APNs sender: token-based auth (JWT ES256 from the .p8 key) over HTTP/2 (node:http2). No dependencies.
// Canonical copy: push/src (see scripts/sync-push.sh).
//
// Payload: aps.alert {title, body}; the app data goes into the top-level `body` object, which is what
